(5694210, 828644, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w work and a cute family portrait. I assume mom is behind the lens.</td>', 'Nice b/w work and a cute family portrait. I assume mom is behind the lens.', '2009-10-21 01:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694216, 828678, 83313, '<td valign="top">I am not sure what this represents about your corner of the world, but this topic is so wide open to personal interpretation, that on this one I must assume there is a connection I am not understanding.</td>', 'I am not sure what this represents about your corner of the world, but this topic is so wide open to personal interpretation, that on this one I must assume there is a connection I am not understanding.', '2009-10-21 01:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694233, 828709, 83313, '<td valign="top">An awfully cute kid. Looks like she is trying to appear innocent. Harsh flash and a slight color cast are a problem for this shot. I try to avoid forward facing on-camera flash at all costs. I''ll bet this would have worked out nicely with the use of existing room light. (You would certainly need to use a tripod, however.)</td>', 'An awfully cute kid. Looks like she is trying to appear innocent. Harsh flash and a slight color cast are a problem for this shot. I try to avoid forward facing on-camera flash at all costs. I''ll bet this would have worked out nicely with the use of existing room light. (You would certainly need to use a tripod, however.)', '2009-10-21 01:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694238, 828320, 83313, '<td valign="top">Umm... Argentina? Ireland? Japan? (Feel free to ignore me.)</td>', 'Umm... Argentina? Ireland? Japan? (Feel free to ignore me.)', '2009-10-21 01:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
