(5694420, 828418, 108525, '<td valign="top">This photo has serious potential.  It has great composition, but is lacking in a few other technical areas.  <br/>It seems a bit over exsposed in areas of the horizon, and under exposed in the left foreground.  It also seems like there is a bit of camera shake?...as there is a loss of detail/ focus in the foreground.</td>', 'This photo has serious potential.  It has great composition, but is lacking in a few other technical areas.  It seems a bit over exsposed in areas of the horizon, and under exposed in the left foreground.  It also seems like there is a bit of camera shake?...as there is a loss of detail/ focus in the foreground.', '2009-10-21 02:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
