(5694463, 828203, 108525, '<td valign="top">I love the color and composition.  Having both hands in the shot is great.<br/> <br/>I just wish the two dark lines on either side of the adult hand weren''t there.  I also wish that the numbers were lined up in some way, instead of being so random.</td>', 'I love the color and composition.  Having both hands in the shot is great. I just wish the two dark lines on either side of the adult hand weren''t there.  I also wish that the numbers were lined up in some way, instead of being so random.', '2009-10-21 02:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694469, 828090, 108525, '<td valign="top">The colors are great, and I like the composition for the most part.  I just wish that you had either cropped off more of the sky or placed the horizon in the center (one of the few times I think placing it in the center would work).</td>', 'The colors are great, and I like the composition for the most part.  I just wish that you had either cropped off more of the sky or placed the horizon in the center (one of the few times I think placing it in the center would work).', '2009-10-21 02:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694473, 828768, 108525, '<td valign="top">I think it would help to bump the color saturation a bit or to make it monochromatic.</td>', 'I think it would help to bump the color saturation a bit or to make it monochromatic.', '2009-10-21 02:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5694481, 828518, 108525, '<td valign="top">The background seems a bit dark/ under exposed. It''s hard to tell what''s going on back there.  A bounced flash would have helped.</td>', 'The background seems a bit dark/ under exposed. It''s hard to tell what''s going on back there.  A bounced flash would have helped.', '2009-10-21 02:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
