(5695598, 828439, 72034, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the fisheye look here. I think a longer lens would have worked out better.  Maybe throw on a neutral density filter to get some motion blur in the water as well?</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the fisheye look here. I think a longer lens would have worked out better.  Maybe throw on a neutral density filter to get some motion blur in the water as well?', '2009-10-21 13:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
