(5697753, 828276, 69008, '<td valign="top">Fire, smoke, and speed. It looks like good expensive fun. I like the sky in this shot but  I wouldn''t want to live where there is so little vegetation for very long.</td>', 'Fire, smoke, and speed. It looks like good expensive fun. I like the sky in this shot but  I wouldn''t want to live where there is so little vegetation for very long.', '2009-10-23 00:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
