(5699181, 828793, 33161, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome. I was next to this bridge in May. We had a short time here after our trip to Yosemite. I only had a couple hours and it was the wrong time of day for a nice image. It was filled up with tourist and what not. The parking was miserable. We drove down to that light house and fort nearby. I know one thing. That little town nearby is really expensive to do anything in. Thanks for the nice picture.</td>', 'Simply awesome. I was next to this bridge in May. We had a short time here after our trip to Yosemite. I only had a couple hours and it was the wrong time of day for a nice image. It was filled up with tourist and what not. The parking was miserable. We drove down to that light house and fort nearby. I know one thing. That little town nearby is really expensive to do anything in. Thanks for the nice picture.', '2009-10-24 14:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5699184, 828712, 33161, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Really nice composition. Great!! I really like the tonality of this image.</td>', 'Nice image. Really nice composition. Great!! I really like the tonality of this image.', '2009-10-24 14:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
