(5699225, 828518, 102278, '<td valign="top">I think this is great. It''ll probably get low marks but it''s in my top 5. I''m giving it a 9. It''s different, unusual and has a great atmosphere about it. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'I think this is great. It''ll probably get low marks but it''s in my top 5. I''m giving it a 9. It''s different, unusual and has a great atmosphere about it. Wonderful shot.', '2009-10-24 16:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5699232, 828495, 102278, '<td valign="top">Good reportage image about an issue that, i imagine, is prevalent in your area. Interesting take on the challenge which i like very much. One''s corner of the world is shaped as much by it''s people and politics as by it''s landscape so i applaud you for that. The actual anti-choice message given by the woman is one which i find abhorrent so there is an added emotional content there as well of course. Excellent. 9.</td>', 'Good reportage image about an issue that, i imagine, is prevalent in your area. Interesting take on the challenge which i like very much. One''s corner of the world is shaped as much by it''s people and politics as by it''s landscape so i applaud you for that. The actual anti-choice message given by the woman is one which i find abhorrent so there is an added emotional content there as well of course. Excellent. 9.', '2009-10-24 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5699248, 828656, 51269, '<td valign="top">Looks very familiar :) Excellent !</td>', 'Looks very familiar :) Excellent !', '2009-10-24 16:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
