(5703616, 828712, 67258, '<td valign="top">Thought this was Fountains!  You and I were there on the same day, but I went for the Tryptych challenge - <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=828249" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1110/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_828249.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1110/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_828249.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1110/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_828249.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>You have captured the feel of the day well (grey!) - particularly impressed with your control of the verticals.</td>', 'Thought this was Fountains!  You and I were there on the same day, but I went for the Tryptych challenge -   You have captured the feel of the day well (grey!) - particularly impressed with your control of the verticals.', '2009-10-28 07:40:21.000000', NULL, 0),
