(5704523, 828805, 64446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Ouch. I had expected with all those artifacts, that this was an entry from a newbie member. Any idea yet what  caused the blocky artifacts? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Hey Steve, thanks for the comments.<br/>Something''s not right with the way I''m doing the export process on Lightroom. I had to lower the quality to 20% to get within the 150Kb size, thus the low quality, I presume. I couldn''t find out how get around that....</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Ouch. I had expected with all those artifacts, that this was an entry from a newbie member. Any idea yet what  caused the blocky artifacts?  Hey Steve, thanks for the comments.Something''s not right with the way I''m doing the export process on Lightroom. I had to lower the quality to 20% to get within the 150Kb size, thus the low quality, I presume. I couldn''t find out how get around that....', '2009-10-28 17:57:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5704773, 828472, 89230, '<td valign="top">I know this is after the challenge ended, but I am just looking at them. I really like this photo. Really like. But if I could do one thing differently, Id crop it to a landscape and have a lot less sky. Beautiful, nonetheless.</td>', 'I know this is after the challenge ended, but I am just looking at them. I really like this photo. Really like. But if I could do one thing differently, Id crop it to a landscape and have a lot less sky. Beautiful, nonetheless.', '2009-10-28 21:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
