(5704789, 828500, 89230, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo. You did very well in choosing the location with the fisheye. Im not surprised this finished so low in the challenge, considering your audience. However, I hope you''re not discouraged because i think this is great. You used the terrain and the effect the lens provided and came up with a true work of art.</td>', 'This is a great photo. You did very well in choosing the location with the fisheye. Im not surprised this finished so low in the challenge, considering your audience. However, I hope you''re not discouraged because i think this is great. You used the terrain and the effect the lens provided and came up with a true work of art.', '2009-10-28 21:17:00.000000', NULL, 0),
